<section class="fleet-map-section" data-fleet-map data-map-url="<%= url('speed-map-data',{date:speedSceneData.date}) %>">
 <script type="application/json" data-map-recaps><%- JSON.stringify(speedSceneData).replace(/</g,'\\u003c') %></script>
 <header class="fleet-heading"><div><h3>Peta DT Bengalon</h3><p>Satelit Esri dan rekaman GPS Bengalon. Klik DT untuk melihat speed dan preview 3D.</p></div><form method="get" action="<%= url('speed-dashboard') %>" class="scene-date-form"><% for(const key of ['from','to']){if(speedFilters[key]){ %><input type="hidden" name="<%= key %>" value="<%= speedFilters[key] %>"><% }} %><label>Tanggal rekaman<input type="date" name="scene_date" value="<%= speedSceneData.date %>" required></label><button type="submit" class="subtle-button">Tampilkan</button></form></header>
 <div class="map-summary"><strong><%= speedSceneData.items.length %> DT dalam rekap</strong><span><%= dateId(speedSceneData.date) %></span><span data-map-coverage>Memuat posisi GPS…</span><div class="map-summary-actions"><button type="button" class="subtle-button" data-map-list-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="fleet-map-unit-list">Daftar DT</button><button type="button" class="subtle-button" data-map-fit>Seluruh area</button><button type="button" class="subtle-button" data-map-expand>Perluas peta</button></div></div>
 <div class="fleet-map-workspace">
  <div class="fleet-map-stage"><div class="fleet-map-canvas" data-map-canvas role="application" aria-label="Peta GPS historis dump truck. Klik kelompok untuk memperbesar, atau buka Daftar DT untuk memilih dengan keyboard."></div><canvas class="map-trucks" data-map-trucks aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
   <div class="map-badges"><span class="map-mode-badge">REKAMAN GPS</span><strong data-map-clock>--:--:-- WIB</strong><span data-map-position-count>0 posisi</span></div>
   <div class="map-layer-tools"><a class="map-earth-link" href="https://earth.google.com/web/search/Bengalon,+Kalimantan+Timur" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Earth ↗</a><label>Peta<select data-map-layer><option value="satellite">Satelit Esri</option><option value="road">Jalan</option><option value="plain">Koordinat saja</option></select></label><label>DT<select data-map-mode><option value="operational">Bergerak + parkir ilustrasi</option><option value="gps">Semua posisi GPS</option></select></label><label><input type="checkbox" data-map-follow> Ikuti DT</label></div>
   <div class="map-loading" data-map-loading role="status">Memuat rekaman dan peta…</div><div class="map-status" data-map-status hidden role="status"></div>
   <div class="map-legend"><span><i class="legend-moving"></i>Bergerak</span><span><i class="legend-stopped"></i>Berhenti</span><span>Ikon DT bertumpuk · klik untuk perbesar</span></div>
   <div class="map-pick-hint" data-map-pick-hint>Scroll / cubit trackpad untuk zoom peta · klik DT untuk preview</div>
  </div>
  <aside class="map-unit-panel" id="fleet-map-unit-list" hidden><div class="map-panel-head"><strong>Unit pada rekaman</strong><span>Speed GPS pada waktu pilihan</span></div><label class="scene-search-label">Cari DT<input type="search" data-map-search placeholder="Contoh: DT2684"></label><div class="map-unit-records" data-map-records></div><div class="map-selected-info" data-map-selected hidden></div><a class="subtle-button map-report-link" data-map-report href="<%= url('speed-units') %>">Daftar semua unit</a></aside>
 </div>
 <section class="map-parking-panel" data-map-parking hidden><div class="map-parking-heading"><div><h4>Area parkir ilustrasi</h4><p>DT berhenti atau belum punya titik GPS terkini. Susunan parkir ini bukan lokasi GPS atau status workshop.</p></div><label>Cari DT di parkir<input type="search" data-parking-search placeholder="Nomor DT"></label></div><div class="map-parking-lot" data-parking-records></div><p class="map-parking-empty" data-parking-empty hidden>Tidak ada DT yang cocok pada waktu ini. Ubah waktu rekaman atau pencarian.</p><div class="map-parking-pagination"><button type="button" class="subtle-button" data-parking-prev>Sebelumnya</button><span data-parking-page aria-live="polite"></span><button type="button" class="subtle-button" data-parking-next>Berikutnya</button></div></section>
 <footer class="map-timebar"><div class="map-time-heading"><label for="map-replay-time">Waktu rekaman · WIB</label><strong data-map-time-label>--:--</strong><label class="map-playback-rate">Kecepatan putar ulang<select data-map-rate><option value="1" selected>1× · waktu normal</option><option value="5">5×</option><option value="10">10×</option><option value="60">60×</option><option value="240">240×</option><option value="960">960×</option></select></label></div><input id="map-replay-time" type="range" data-map-time min="0" max="86399" value="28800" step="1" aria-label="Pilih waktu rekaman GPS"><div class="map-time-ticks"><span>00.00</span><span>06.00</span><span>12.00</span><span>18.00</span><span>23.59</span></div><p>Gambar DT bertumpuk mewakili unit yang berdekatan. Posisi menahan titik GPS terakhir saat jarak rekaman terlalu lebar; gerak hanya dihaluskan antar titik yang dekat. Speed berasal dari rekaman terakhir. Citra satelit dapat berbeda tanggal dengan GPS. Peta jalan khusus Mintegra belum tersedia; posisi tidak digeser ke jalan yang belum terverifikasi.</p></footer>
</section>
